70 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 32 0 R/E(You're running teams, projects and organisations. Often through screens, across borders and sometimes across several time zones. The VALE Forum creates space to explore that reality together.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

71 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 32 0 R/E(Through Open Space sessions, participant-led workshops, reflection groups and informal conversations, fifty people will bring their own experiences, questions and challenges into the room.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[11]>>
